OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely fine
OL,6,Fand dry this evening and overnight,
OL,7,Fthough a few isolated spots of rain
OL,8,Fare possible, mainly before midnight.
OL,9,FIt will remain rather muggy for many,
OL,10,Fwith light winds and mild temperatures
OL,11,Fin places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAny early sunshine will
OL,14,Fgradually give way to increasing cloud
OL,15,Ffrom the west, bringing a slight
OL,16,Fchance of an afternoon shower. Still
OL,17,Fwarm in Kent. Staying dry through the
OL,18,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
