OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Tuesday. Windier
OL,7,FWednesday, largely dry but some
OL,8,Fblustery showers in Kent. Dry
OL,9,FThursday, with light winds and hazy
OL,10,Fsunshine. Temperatures around average
OL,11,Ffor early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
